###
# VentasPro SaaS Multi-Tenant - API Examples
# Usa este archivo con REST Client extension de VS Code
# O copia los curl commands a tu terminal
###

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002/api
@cookie = tenant_id=s:1.XXXX  # Reemplaza con tu cookie real después de login

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### AUTH - Autenticación
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "daveymena16@gmail.com",
  "password": "tu_password"
}

### Get current user (verifica si eres admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### TENANT CONFIG - Configuración Multi-Tenant
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Get all configuration
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenant-config/all
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Get Facebook configuration
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenant-config/facebook
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Update Facebook configuration
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tenant-config/facebook
Cookie: {{cookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appId": "tu_app_id",
  "appSecret": "tu_app_secret",
  "pageId": "tu_page_id",
  "pageAccessToken": "tu_page_token",
  "adAccountId": "tu_ad_account_id",
  "webhookVerifyToken": "tu_webhook_token",
  "messengerVerifyToken": "tu_messenger_token",
  "enabled": true
}

### Get Payment configuration
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenant-config/payments
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Update Payment configuration
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tenant-config/payments
Cookie: {{cookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mercadopago": {
    "accessToken": "APP_USR-tu_token",
    "publicKey": "APP_USR-tu_public_key",
    "enabled": true
  },
  "paypal": {
    "clientId": "tu_client_id",
    "clientSecret": "tu_client_secret",
    "mode": "live",
    "enabled": true
  },
  "transfer": {
    "enabled": true,
    "accounts": [
      {
        "type": "Nequi",
        "number": "573136174267",
        "name": "Deiner Mena"
      }
    ]
  }
}

### Get Email configuration
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenant-config/email
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Update Email configuration
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tenant-config/email
Cookie: {{cookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "smtpHost": "smtp.gmail.com",
  "smtpPort": 587,
  "smtpUser": "tu_email@gmail.com",
  "smtpPassword": "tu_app_password",
  "emailFrom": "noreply@tudominio.com",
  "emailTo": "notificaciones@tudominio.com",
  "enabled": true
}

### Get API Keys
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenant-config/api-keys
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Update API Keys
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tenant-config/api-keys
Cookie: {{cookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "openai": "sk-tu_openai_key",
  "groq": "gsk_tu_groq_key",
  "nvidia": "nvapi-tu_nvidia_key",
  "opencode": "sk-tu_opencode_key",
  "opencodeZen": "sk-tu_zen_key",
  "github": "ghp_tu_github_token",
  "pexels": "tu_pexels_key"
}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### WHATSAPP - Gestión de WhatsApp
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Get WhatsApp status
GET {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/status
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Network check (diagnóstico)
GET {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/network-check
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Session info
GET {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/session-info
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Connect WhatsApp (con reintentos)
POST {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/connect
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Pair with phone number
POST {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/pair-phone
Cookie: {{cookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "573001234567"
}

### Reset session
POST {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/reset-session
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Disconnect
POST {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/disconnect
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### ADMIN ONLY - Requiere isAdmin=true
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### List all WhatsApp instances (todas las sesiones)
GET {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/instances
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Get metrics (métricas por tenant)
GET {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/metrics
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Get health summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/health
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Cleanup inactive instances
POST {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/cleanup
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Start specific tenant instance
POST {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/instances/1/start
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Dispose specific tenant instance
POST {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/instances/2/dispose
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### CURL EXAMPLES - Para usar en terminal
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Login y guardar cookie
# curl -X POST http://localhost:3002/api/auth/login \
#   -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
#   -d '{"email":"daveymena16@gmail.com","password":"tu_pass"}' \
#   -c cookies.txt

# Get all config (usando cookie guardada)
# curl http://localhost:3002/api/tenant-config/all \
#   -b cookies.txt | jq

# Network check
# curl http://localhost:3002/api/whatsapp/network-check \
#   -b cookies.txt | jq

# WhatsApp connect
# curl -X POST http://localhost:3002/api/whatsapp/connect \
#   -b cookies.txt | jq

# Update Facebook config
# curl -X PUT http://localhost:3002/api/tenant-config/facebook \
#   -b cookies.txt \
#   -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
#   -d '{
#     "appId": "tu_app_id",
#     "appSecret": "tu_secret",
#     "enabled": true
#   }' | jq

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### TESTING SCENARIOS
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Scenario 1: Admin verifica su status
# 1. Login
# 2. GET /api/auth/me
# 3. Verificar que isAdmin = true

### Scenario 2: Configurar integraciones de Facebook
# 1. Login
# 2. GET /api/tenant-config/facebook (ver config actual)
# 3. PUT /api/tenant-config/facebook (actualizar)
# 4. GET /api/tenant-config/facebook (verificar cambios)

### Scenario 3: Conectar WhatsApp con QR mejorado
# 1. Login
# 2. GET /api/whatsapp/network-check (diagnóstico previo)
# 3. POST /api/whatsapp/connect (timeout 30s, 3 reintentos)
# 4. GET /api/whatsapp/status (ver QR o estado)

### Scenario 4: Admin ve todas las instancias
# 1. Login como admin
# 2. GET /api/whatsapp/instances (todas las sesiones)
# 3. GET /api/whatsapp/metrics (métricas detalladas)
# 4. POST /api/whatsapp/cleanup (limpiar inactivas)

